config ZX279128_MDIO
	bool "ZTE ZX279128S MDIO bus controller"
	depends on OF && HAS_IOMEM
	help
	  Support for the MDIO bus controller in the ZTE ZX279128S SoC
	  (ZXHN E1600). The controller drives the management interface
	  to the four integrated GbE PHYs (GEPHY) at addresses 0-3.

	  If unsure, say N.
